OL,3,GNEWSAWhy cicada buzz is being heard in
OL,4,Aa churchyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a sound you are more likely to
OL,7,Fhear during a summer holiday in Greece
OL,8,Fthan in a churchyard in Derbyshire.
OL,10,FAngela Neale initially thought there
OL,11,Fwas an electrical fault or a "drone
OL,12,Ftrapped up in a tree" when she heard a
OL,13,Fpersistent buzzing near her home in
OL,14,FMatlock.
OL,16,FBut when a passer-by likened the noise
OL,17,Fin the St Giles' churchyard to a cicada
OL,18,Fa few days later, she began to consider
OL,19,Fthe possibility the insects might be in
OL,20,Fthe area.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
