OL,3,GNEWSAWhy cicada buzz is being heard in
OL,4,Aa churchyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FCicadas are large, plant-feeding
OL,7,Finsects, famous for the loud, buzzing
OL,8,Fmating songs males make during warm
OL,9,Fsummer months. They are found all
OL,10,Faround the world, but they thrive in
OL,11,Fhigh temperature and tropical climates.
